      "seed": 1985130519,
      "version": 564,
      "versionNonce": 1428372569,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784877911686,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nGET SRS STATUS\n\nRequirements \n- Should support large payload query ( >10MB) \n-  It should be secure.\n- Response time should be under 700ms ( Need to check what is the timeout configured in CPI ) \n\nCurrent Architecture \n\nAPI Gateway maximum payload size limit 10MB\nLambda maximum payload size limit : 6MB  ( Approx: 5000 job payload ) \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nGET SRS STATUS\n\nRequirements \n- Should support large payload query ( >10MB) \n-  It should be secure.\n- Response time should be under 700ms ( Need to check what is the timeout configured in CPI ) \n\nCurrent Architecture \n\nAPI Gateway maximum payload size limit 10MB\nLambda maximum payload size limit : 6MB  ( Approx: 5000 job payload ) \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
