      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784877911687,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Other considerations which may not feasible \n\n- Direct traffic to EC2 ( handle the proxy, WAF etc. manually )\n   Reason: \n   - All current nucleus traffic comes through NLB -> ALB->target groups \n   - Domain name is attached to NLB\n   - To support this we need to add EC2 a public IP and attach a sub domain. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Other considerations which may not feasible \n\n- Direct traffic to EC2 ( handle the proxy, WAF etc. manually )\n   Reason: \n   - All current nucleus traffic comes through NLB -> ALB->target groups \n   - Domain name is attached to NLB\n   - To support this we need to add EC2 a public IP and attach a sub domain. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
